title: Start
---
<<declare $name = "Mira">>
<<declare $coins = 7>>
Mira: Hello, {$name}. You have {$coins} coins. #line:greeting
-> Visit the market. #line:visit
    Mira: The market is open. #line:market
-> Wait here. #line:wait
    Mira: We can take our time. #line:rest
Mira: See you soon. #line:goodbye
